        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "✓ Baseball, an essentially rural sport that mimics the rhythms of agrarian time, satisfies our admiration for precision, basketball, our newest sport and now more urban than rural, speaks to our love of speed and grace, and football, a sport both rural and urban, appeals to our lust for violence.",
